<main id="content" tabindex="-1">

<div class="page-head"><div><h1>API keys</h1><p>An API key lets a tool or script use the Hub on your behalf, limited to what you choose here. A key can never do more than you can.</p></div></div>
<div class="stack">
<section class="panel" aria-labelledby="create-apikey">
  <h2 id="create-apikey">Create an API key <button type="button" class="info-btn" popovertarget="help-api-key-scopes" aria-label="About API key scopes"><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-info"/></svg></button></h2>
  <div class="info-pop" id="help-api-key-scopes" popover><p>A scope says what the key can reach and which actions it can take there. Choose only what the tool needs.</p></div>
  <form method="post" hx-post="/api-keys" hx-target="#create-result" hx-swap="innerHTML" hx-disabled-elt="find button[type=submit]">
    <div class="field">
      <label for="key-name">Name</label>
      <input type="text" id="key-name" name="name" autocomplete="off" required maxlength="64" placeholder="e.g. build monitor">
    </div>
    <fieldset class="field">
      <legend>What the key may reach</legend>
      <label class="check" for="res-0"><input type="checkbox" id="res-0" name="resource" value="user:0190a1b2-c3d4-7e5f-8a6b-0000000000b0" checked> My account <span class="muted">(all my Workers and sessions, now and later)</span></label>
      <label class="check" for="res-1"><input type="checkbox" id="res-1" name="resource" value="worker:0190a1b2-c3d4-7e5f-8a6b-0000000000c1"> Worker pi <span class="muted">(this Worker and all its sessions)</span></label>
      <label class="check" for="res-2"><input type="checkbox" id="res-2" name="resource" value="worker:0190a1b2-c3d4-7e5f-8a6b-0000000000c2"> Worker nuc <span class="muted">(this Worker and all its sessions)</span></label>
      
      
    </fieldset>
    <div class="field">
      <label for="key-session">Only one session (optional)</label>
      <input type="text" id="key-session" name="session" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" maxlength="128" aria-describedby="key-session-help" placeholder="e.g. nightly-build">
      <span id="key-session-help" class="muted field-hint">The name of a session. Choose exactly one Worker above, and the key reaches only that session.</span>
    </div>
    <fieldset class="field">
      <legend>What the key may do</legend>
      <label class="check" for="act-0"><input type="checkbox" id="act-0" name="action" value="read" checked> Read <span class="muted">(see Workers, sessions and screens)</span></label>
      <label class="check" for="act-1"><input type="checkbox" id="act-1" name="action" value="operate"> Operate <span class="muted">(type, send keys, create sessions, answer dialogs)</span></label>
      <label class="check" for="act-2"><input type="checkbox" id="act-2" name="action" value="message"> Message <span class="muted">(send messages to agent sessions only)</span></label>
      <label class="check" for="act-3"><input type="checkbox" id="act-3" name="action" value="file_read"> Pull files <span class="muted">(list session folders and download files from them)</span></label>
      <label class="check" for="act-4"><input type="checkbox" id="act-4" name="action" value="file_write"> Push files <span class="muted">(upload files into session folders)</span></label>
      <label class="check" for="act-5"><input type="checkbox" id="act-5" name="action" value="app_install"> Install apps <span class="muted">(install apps on Android Workers from their Minion files folder)</span></label>
      
    </fieldset>
    <div class="field">
      <label for="key-bound">Call key for a Worker (optional)</label>
      <select id="key-bound" name="bound_worker" aria-describedby="key-bound-help">
        <option value="">Not a call key</option>
        <option value="0190a1b2-c3d4-7e5f-8a6b-0000000000c1">pi</option>
        <option value="0190a1b2-c3d4-7e5f-8a6b-0000000000c2">nuc</option>
        
      </select>
      <span id="key-bound-help" class="muted">Binds the key to that Worker so it can message the targets chosen above on its behalf. Use it with <code>call_api_key_file</code> on that Worker. A bound key works only on that Worker's own connection.</span>
    </div>
    <div class="field">
      <label for="key-expires">Valid for</label>
      <select id="key-expires" name="expires">
        <option value="30d">30 days</option>
        <option value="90d" selected>90 days</option>
        <option value="1y">1 year</option>
        
      </select>
    </div>
    <button type="submit"><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-plus"/></svg><span>Create the key</span></button>
    <div id="create-result" aria-live="polite"></div>
  </form>
  <noscript><p class="muted">Creating a key needs JavaScript in this browser.</p></noscript>
</section>
<section aria-labelledby="apikey-list">
  <h2 id="apikey-list">Your API keys</h2>
  <div class="table-wrap"><table data-sortable>
    <thead><tr><th scope="col" data-sort="text">Name</th><th scope="col" data-sort="text">Key</th><th scope="col" data-sort="text">Reaches and may do</th><th scope="col" data-sort="text">Expires</th><th scope="col" data-sort="text">Last used</th><th scope="col" data-sort="text">State</th><th scope="col"><span class="muted">Actions</span></th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    <tr>
      <th scope="row">ci</th>
      <td class="cell-clamp" title="mn_mfrggzdf..." tabindex="0"><code>mn_mfrggzdf...</code></td>
      <td class="cell-clamp" title="Worker pi: read, operate" tabindex="0">Worker pi: read, operate</td>
      <td><time datetime="2026-11-16T08:30:00Z">2026-11-16 08:30 UTC</time></td>
      <td>2026-11-09 07:30 UTC</td>
      <td>active</td>
      <td><form method="post" hx-post="/api-keys/0190a1b2-c3d4-7e5f-8a6b-0000000000e1/revoke" hx-target="#revoke-0190a1b2-c3d4-7e5f-8a6b-0000000000e1" hx-swap="innerHTML" hx-confirm="Revoke this API key? Tools that use it stop working at once." hx-disabled-elt="find button">
          <button type="submit" class="btn-danger"><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-trash"/></svg><span>Revoke ci</span></button>
          <span id="revoke-0190a1b2-c3d4-7e5f-8a6b-0000000000e1" aria-live="polite"></span>
        </form></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <th scope="row">mcp</th>
      <td class="cell-clamp" title="mn_mztwq2lk..." tabindex="0"><code>mn_mztwq2lk...</code></td>
      <td class="cell-clamp" title="my account: read" tabindex="0">my account: read</td>
      <td>never</td>
      <td>never used</td>
      <td>active</td>
      <td><form method="post" hx-post="/api-keys/0190a1b2-c3d4-7e5f-8a6b-0000000000e2/revoke" hx-target="#revoke-0190a1b2-c3d4-7e5f-8a6b-0000000000e2" hx-swap="innerHTML" hx-confirm="Revoke this API key? Tools that use it stop working at once." hx-disabled-elt="find button">
          <button type="submit" class="btn-danger"><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-trash"/></svg><span>Revoke mcp</span></button>
          <span id="revoke-0190a1b2-c3d4-7e5f-8a6b-0000000000e2" aria-live="polite"></span>
        </form></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <th scope="row">gone</th>
      <td class="cell-clamp" title="mn_nnwg23tp..." tabindex="0"><code>mn_nnwg23tp...</code></td>
      <td class="cell-clamp" title="session build on nuc: message" tabindex="0">session build on nuc: message</td>
      <td>never</td>
      <td>never used</td>
      <td>revoked</td>
      <td><span class="muted">none</span></td>
    </tr>
    
    </tbody>
  </table></div>
</section>
</div>
<script src="/onboarding.js" defer></script>

    </main>